      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality. my partner is working two jobs just to keep us afloat because i can't get my head straight, and my child is always seeing me like this. it feels selfish just to stay and keep making them struggle. like, every day i'm just another problem they have to solve.",
